      <marc:subfield code="a">This book has the potential to transform your life. It has guided millions of people towards a life of happiness and fulfillment. In this book, Norman Vincent Peale, often called the father of positive thinking, shares simple, practical, and heartfelt methods to help anyone live with courage, success, and joy. As one of the most widely read motivational authors in the world, his message of faith and positive thinking has been embraced by countless readers. Peale’s teachings help to erase a defeatist mindset, awaken the inner strength within each person, and lead them to live a truly remarkable life.</marc:subfield>
